{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01038","headline":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 四 · 刘希夷","name":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皓如楚江月，霭若吴岫云。\n波中自皎镜，山上亦氛氲。\n明月留照妾，轻云持赠君。\n山川各离散，光气乃殊分。\n天涯一爲别，江北自相闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}